Powers:           x^{2}  OR  x^{10}   (always use braces for multi-char exponents)
Subscripts:       x_{0}  OR  v_{max}  (always use braces)
Greek letters:    \\alpha  \\beta  \\gamma  \\delta  \\theta  \\phi  \\omega  \\lambda  \\mu  \\pi  \\eta  \\rho  \\sigma
